/sbi-logs/
/archive/
/.claude/

# A 6.9 MB run log that was committed to the repo root. Ignoring it stops it coming back;
# it is still TRACKED, so untracking is a separate, deliberate step (see PRISM_HANDOFF 9.7).
/sbc_run.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/

# Resources/ GENERATED OUTPUTS (PRISM_HANDOFF 9.7).
# Resources/ interleaves the hand-written inputs a user edits -- Bounds/ Cells/ Units/ Models/ --
# with everything the pipeline writes, so the two were indistinguishable in the same tree. The
# directories below are outputs only; the input .txt/.json files stay tracked.
# Some of these are still TRACKED from before this rule; untracking them is a separate, deliberate
# step (same reasoning as sbc_run.log above), and ignoring them stops NEW ones being added.
/Resources/Plots/
/Resources/Priors/
/Resources/Posteriors/
/Resources/CrossValidation/
/Resources/ReductionMap/
